  "prefLabel": "Mec 401.05 State plumbing code",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 401.05 \"State plumbing code\" means that part of the state building code, as defined in RSA 155-A:1, IV, which regulates plumbing, as modified by the state building code review board within the limits established by RSA 155-A:10, V.\n\nSource. #10848, eff 7-1-15; ss by #13771, eff 12-10-23 (formerly Saf-Mec 401.02) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Mec 400)",
